            <li><span class="tick"></span><span>Testiranje/mjerenje i zapisnik</span></li>
            <li><span class="tick"></span><span>Dokumentacija (shema, portovi, oznake)</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h4>Zašto investirati u SKS</h4>
          <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:10px;">
            <div class="card" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);">
